    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Over 36 Years of Expertise in Taiwan 
    &lt;div id=&#34;over-36-years-of-expertise-in-taiwan&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#over-36-years-of-expertise-in-taiwan&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 1986 as Hsing Chia Enterprise, Chia Kuan has evolved over more than three decades into a trusted name in plastic injection molding and mold development. In 1996, the company expanded its capital and adopted the name Chia Kuan Co., Ltd., building on a foundation of meticulous production processes and a steadfast commitment to delivering defect-free products. Our experience and attention to detail ensure stable quality and smooth project execution for every client.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
